{"id":"b650dc2733f4802d","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-perfect-embedding-degrees.md","title":"可计算完美嵌入给出全部 Turing 度","display":"thm-perfect-embedding-degrees — 可计算完美嵌入给出全部 Turing 度","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-perfect-embedding-degrees","aliases":["20-thm-perfect-embedding-degrees"],"display":"thm-perfect-embedding-degrees — 可计算完美嵌入给出全部 Turing 度","chapter":"9","section":"9.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"§9.6；Theorem 9.6.1 前的说明","source_printed_pages":[180],"source_pdf_pages":[212],"depends_on":["[[20-df-computable-tree-embedding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-perfect-embedding-degrees"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-perfect-embedding-degrees</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-perfect-embedding-degrees — 可计算完美嵌入给出全部 Turing 度"},{"key":"chapter","html":"9"},{"key":"section","html":"9.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§9.6；Theorem 9.6.1 前的说明"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>180</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>212</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ecb9f43e837dcf35\" href=\"?note=ecb9f43e837dcf35\" title=\"20-df-computable-tree-embedding\">20-df-computable-tree-embedding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PerfectEmbed}(g,T)\">\\(\\operatorname{PerfectEmbed}(g,T)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y=\\bigcup_n g(X\\upharpoonright n)\">\\(Y=\\bigcup_n g(X\\upharpoonright n)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ecb9f43e837dcf35\" href=\"?note=ecb9f43e837dcf35\" title=\"20-df-computable-tree-embedding\">20-df-computable-tree-embedding</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}perfect-embedding-degrees}\\vdash\nY\\in[T]\\quad\\land\\quad Y\\equiv_T X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}perfect-embedding-degrees}\\vdash\nY\\in[T]\\quad\\land\\quad Y\\equiv_T X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 有效计算任意足够长的值串；从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 搜索 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(\\sigma)\\preceq Y\">\\(g(\\sigma)\\preceq Y\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\sigma|&gt;n\">\\(|\\sigma|&gt;n\\)</span> 的域串。不同同长域串的值不相容，故该串必须为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的前缀，其第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 位即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X(n)\">\\(X(n)\\)</span>。搜索终止由实际路径上的严格增长保证。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.6；Theorem 9.6.1 前的说明；印刷页 180；PDF 第 212 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable-tree-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"ecb9f43e837dcf35","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-tree-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable-tree-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"ecb9f43e837dcf35","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-tree-embedding]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{PerfectEmbed}(g,T)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"Y=\\bigcup_n g(X\\upharpoonright n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}perfect-embedding-degrees}\\vdash\nY\\in[T]\\quad\\land\\quad Y\\equiv_T X.","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"g(\\sigma)\\preceq Y","display":false},{"tex":"|\\sigma|>n","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"X(n)","display":false}],"bytes":1282,"backlinks":[{"id":"d467a7b6bbdb1c63","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-basis]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]；see [[20-lem-functional-perfect-embedding]]；see [[20-thm-perfect-embedding-degrees]]。"}],"outgoing":["ecb9f43e837dcf35"]}